---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { localizedPath } from '../i18n/config';
import { routes } from '../i18n/routes';
import { t } from '../i18n/ui';

const lang = 'en';
const cards = [
  { href: localizedPath(lang, routes.gettingThere[lang]), title: t(lang, 'nav_getting_there'), blurb: 'Boats and transfers from Rio, São Paulo, Paraty and Mangaratiba.' },
  { href: localizedPath(lang, routes.whereToStay[lang]), title: t(lang, 'nav_stay'), blurb: 'Honest options by budget — and the easiest part of Abraão to stay in.' },
  { href: localizedPath(lang, routes.beaches[lang]), title: t(lang, 'nav_beaches'), blurb: 'Lopes Mendes, wild Aventureiro and the turquoise snorkelling lagoons.' },
  { href: localizedPath(lang, routes.trails[lang]), title: t(lang, 'nav_trails'), blurb: 'The five best hikes and the full T1–T16 trail network.' },
  { href: localizedPath(lang, routes.bestTime[lang]), title: t(lang, 'nav_best_time'), blurb: 'Weather, crowds and prices — and the month a local picks.' },
  { href: localizedPath(lang, routes.faq[lang]), title: t(lang, 'nav_faq'), blurb: 'Money, water, internet, mosquitoes and what to pack.' },
];
const aboutHref = localizedPath(lang, routes.about[lang]);
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Visit Ilha Grande — Local travel guide"
  description="A local, independent travel guide to Ilha Grande, Brazil: how to get there, where to stay, beaches, trails, the best time to visit and practical tips."
  path=""
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <h1>Welcome to Ilha Grande</h1>
      <p>A car-free island of rainforest, empty beaches and quiet trails off the coast of Rio de Janeiro — and an honest, local guide to making the most of it.</p>
      <a class="btn" href={cards[0].href}>Start planning your trip</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>Ilha Grande is a large, mountainous island in the bay of Angra dos Reis, a couple of hours from Rio. It has <strong>no cars and no roads</strong> — just Atlantic rainforest, a network of marked trails, and around <strong>113 beaches</strong> scattered along its coast and across a bay famous for its 365 islands.</p>
    <p>This guide is written and kept up to date by someone who actually lives here. No fluff, no brochure-speak — just what you need to plan a great trip, in your language.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="home-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Plan your trip</h2>
      <div class="pillar-grid">
        {cards.map((c) => (
          <a class="pillar-card" href={c.href}>
            <h3>{c.title}</h3>
            <p>{c.blurb}</p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-author">
    <div class="container">
      <p>This guide is written by <strong>Richard</strong>, who lives on Ilha Grande and runs a small pousada in Vila do Abraão. <a href={aboutHref}>Who writes this →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
